Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Revert: remove StartupDelayInMSec override
; Pair with: disable-startup-delay.reg
; CURSOR-AUDIT #20: Windows default has no explicit value here; the
; ~10s legacy startup delay is largely a no-op on Win11 (the
; StartupApproved model handles startup-app dispatch differently).

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Explorer\Serialize]
"StartupDelayInMSec"=-
